    "details": {
      "alignment": "Lawful Evil",
      "type": {
        "value": "humanoid",
        "subtype": "Koopa"
      },
      "cr": 2,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Kamek.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, hand-authored from the article. XP ledger: level 2, power rating 10 → CR 2 as a spellcaster. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Fallen Regent</strong> — Koopa Troop (Formerly)</p><p>Status: Imprisoned — Stripped of power by Bowser</p><p>Kamek decided that Bowser's methods were obsolete, so he dug under the castle and awoke a world-eating space worm. It went poorly. He sacrificed hundreds of troops, declared himself the 'Regent Sorcerer', and was ultimately defeated by his own construction workers. Bowser has now sentenced him to eternal imprisonment in the very pit he opened. Waluigi thinks Kamek should have just stuck to kidnapping plumbers.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Wand Bolt</strong> — “The greatest wizard in Koopa history was brought down by unionized labor.”</li><li><strong>Magikoopa Spellcasting</strong> — “As the Wyrm's magic flooded into him, he became less a wizard and more a mouthpiece—a corrupted construct wearing Kamek's ambition while the entity beneath the Valley did the actual thinking.”</li><li><strong>The Fallen Regent</strong> — “Imprisoned — Stripped of power by Bowser”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/kamek</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/kamek</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
